tion, declared deliberately: real Latvian puts a transitive infinitive's object in the ACCUSATIVE; that case shift is not modelled, so the fail-sentence object and the counted noun both surface in plain nominative. Plural resolution is binary (one/other), the same simplification pl.json and sl.json declare for their own numeral systems.",
